                <pb facs="1250" n="1146" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg1146"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 823.00/112.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Panama</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-09-09">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 9, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Ex-President Leguía of Peru, with sons Jose and Juan, sailed today steamer <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Tenadores</hi> for New York, arriving September 16.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wicker</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
